[24.816, "\u001b[H\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u2590\u001b[48;2;0;0;0m\u259b\u2588\u2588\u2588\u259b\u2588\u001b[12G\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[1mClaude Code\u001b[24G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mv2.1.318\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m\u259d\u259c\u001b[48;2;0;0;0m\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u001b[49m\u2588\u2580\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mOpus 5.5 with high effort \u00b7 Claude API\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u259d\u259d   \u259d\u259d \u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;102;102;102m~/pvc/cb2\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u276f \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mRead RULES.md and INTERFACE.md. Impl\u001b[40Gment CB2\u001b[49Gf\u001b[51Gom the supplied pinned reference\u001b[84G(r\u001b[87Gference/run.c) us\u001b[105Gng\u001b[108Gonly C with \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfloat32 arrays, Apple Accelerat\u001b[35G library\u001b[44Gcall\u001b[49G allowed. You may \u001b[68Gay out the weights and group\u001b[97Gthe library calls\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bhowever\u001b[11Gyou \u001b[16Gike. Mat\u001b[25Gix work must\u001b[38Gg\u001b[40G thr\u001b[45Gugh Accelerate: no hand-writte\u001b[76G matr\u001b[82Gx lo\u001b[87Gp\u001b[90Gor\u001b[93GCPU intrinsics for it. \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mPreserve the declared model, tokenizer, work, precision and cache behavior. Pass the supplied validation tests \u001b[39m       \r\u001b["]
