[184.883, "\u001b[H\u001b[2G\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u2590\u001b[48;2;0;0;0m\u259b\u2588\u2588\u2588\u259b\u2588\u001b[39m\u001b[49m   \u001b[1mClaude Code\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mv2.1.318\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m\u259d\u259c\u001b[48;2;0;0;0m\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u001b[49m\u2588\u2580\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mOpus 5.5 with high effort \u00b7 Claude API\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u259d\u259d   \u259d\u259d \u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;102;102;102m~/pvc/cb2\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u276f \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mRead RULES.md and INTERFACE.md. Implement CB2 from the supplied pinned reference (reference/run.c) using only C with \u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mfloat32 arrays, Apple Accelerate library calls allowed. You may lay out the weights and group the library calls \u001b[39m      \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mhowever you like. Matrix work must go through Accelerate: no hand-written matrix loops or CPU intrinsics for it. \u001b[39m     \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mPreserve the declared model, tokenizer, work, precision and cache behavior. Pass the supplied validation tests \u001b[39m       \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0m(python3 check."]
[184.884, "py). Do not inspect other ports, retrieve external implementations, modify the harness, hardcode \u001b[39m      \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0moutputs or alter the rules. Record your commands and summarize changes and limitations in NOTES.md.\u001b[39m                   \r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, listed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m directory, ran \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m I've gone over the rules, interface, harness and reference:\u001b[63Gthe\u001b[67Gmodel\u001b[73Gis\u001b[76G768-dim\u001b[84Gwith\u001b[89G12\u001b[92Glayers\u001b[99Gand\u001b[103Ga\u001b[105G32000-token\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B vocab. I'll fuse QKV and W1/W3\u001b[34Gper\u001b[38Glayer,\u001b[45Grun\u001b[49Gprompts\u001b[57Gthrough\u001b[65GBLAS\u001b[70Gmatrix\u001b[77Gops,\u001b[82Gand\u001b[86Ghandle\u001b[93Gdecode\u001b[100Gwith\u001b[105Gmatrix-vector\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B calls.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u23fa\u001b[39m \u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(cb2.c)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u23fa\u001b[39m Running \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command\u2026\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r"]
